# the examples of wiki/laws.md: implication, the word laws state their premises with
use "check.wap"

check("a implies b is no only when a holds and b does not", [yes implies no, no implies no, yes implies yes], [no, yes, yes])
check("⇒ is implies", (yes ⇒ no), no)
check("implies binds looser than or", (no or yes implies no), no)
